      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِذْقَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A piece,</i> or <i>portion cut off,</i> of a rope:
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِذَاقٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُذَاقٌ</span>; as in the phrase, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرَكْتُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحَبْلَ حِذَاقًا</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُذَاقًا</span> [<i>I left the rope in pieces</i>].
(K.) [See also what next follows.]

